 "title": "Off plan | Riyad Bank",
 "text": "Skip to Main Content\nOff plan\nPersonal\nPrivate\nMSME\nCorporate\nInvestor relations\nالعربية\nATM & branches\nContact and Support\nLog in\nCreate account\nAccounts\nCards\nFinance\nHassad\nAbout us\nExplore Banking\nHome\n>\nFinance\n>\nMortgage Loan\n>\nOff plan\nOff-Plan Programs\nOwn a property through off-plan projects in collaboration with the Housing Ministry and benefit from the housing subsidization to purchase the house of your dreams at the best price.\t \nApply Now\n       \n         \nOverview\nEligibility\nHow to apply\nFAQS\nWhat's After Applying Online\nExplore More Options\nApply Now\nOVERVIEW\nOverview\n\nRiyad Bank off-plan program, in collaboration with the Housing Ministry, is specially designed to provide you with the opportunity to own your dream house through approved real estate development projects and Off-Plan Sales Committee (WAFI).\n\nHome Finance features and benefits:\nThe payment period is up to 20 years\nPossibility of having more than one finance\nCooperative insurance against all risks\nExemption in case of death or permanent disability and transfer of ownership of the property to the heirs in accordance with the insurance coverage\nThe repayment period is up to 20 years\nFinancing housing support recipients\nCooperative insurance against all hazards\nExemption in the event of death or total disability (God forbid) and waiver of the property in favor of the heirs directly according to the insurance coverage criteria\n\n \n\n \n\nRead more \nELIGIBILITY\nEligibility\nFor Saudis only\nMinimum monthly salary of S..R 5,000\nFor government, semi-government and private sectors, as well as other bank employees\nSalary transfer is a must (excluding other bank employees)\nHOW TO APPLY\nHow to apply\n\nAll you need to do is visit your nearest Riyad Bank branch with the following documents:\n\nCopy of valid Saudi national ID\nCompleted application form for Home Finance\nCompleted applicant undertaking form\nCompleted applicant health declaration\nDetailed salary certificate with a clear joining date\nBank statement\nDeposit of valuation fees\nYOUR ANSWERS\nFrequently asked questions\nSee all questions\n01\nAre home Finance products Shariah-compliant?\n02\nWhat are the features and benefits of Riyad Bank Home Finance?\n03\n​​​​​​​Is it possible for bank employees to get financed without transferring their salaries?\n04\nWhat is the maximum age required for the property?\n05\nWhat are the properties financed by the bank?\n06\nCan the customer have a joint finance with relatives, such as father, mother, brother, sister, or spouse?\n07\nIs it possible for a non-Saudi husband to have a joint finance with his Saudi wife?\n08\nWhat is the minimum down payment required when purchasing a property?\n09\nWho owns the title deed of the property?\n10\nIs there an early settlement option?\n11\nHow does the profit rate change during the finance period?\n12\nIs it possible to build the land after purchasing it?\n13\nCan the customer lease the property after purchasing it?\n14\nCan the customer sell the property during the repayment period?\n15\nCan the customer have two financing products at the same time?\n16\nIs it possible to finance the purchase of an incomplete property?\n17\nIs it possible to pay quarterly or biannual installments?\n18\nIs it possible to purchase a property without transferring the salary?\n19\nIs it possible to get a Home Finance against shares/deposits?\n20\nWhat are the benefits of life insurance and property insurance?\n21\nWhat is the maximum amount of financing?\n22\nWhat is the minimum amount of financing that can be provided?\n23\nIs there a joint finance option for the Subsidized Home Finance and Al-Moyassar Home Mortgage provided by the Real Estate Development Fund and the Ministry of Housing if the customers’ names were on the subsidization list?\n24\nWhat are the documents required to apply for  the Subsidized Home Finance and Al-Moyassar Home Mortgage?\n25\nWill customers approved by the Ministry/ Fund get an amount of S..R 500,000?\n26\nWhat is the maximum amount of income required for 100% coverage?\n27\nAre there any specifications for selecting the property (regarding space, construction type, etc.) or the subsidization amount offered by the Ministry/Fund ?\n28\nCan a customer with existing Home Finance from Riyad Bank, and nominated by the Ministry/Fund, benefit from the subsidization amount to settle the bank’s finance?\n29\nWhat is the minimum salary required for the Subsidized Home Finance or Al-Moyassar Home Finance?\n30\nCan a customer who owns a land benefit from the subsidized finance if he/she were on the approved list?\n31\nCan an approved customer with a  real estate under construction benefit from the subsidized finance and be financed by Riyad Bank?\n32\nCan an approved customer, who owns a villa, apply for the Home Equity product?\n33\nWhat is the minimum financing amount if the customer wishes to have a home finance from Riyad Bank?\n34\nWhat is the subsidization that the customer will receive from the Fund?\n35\nCan pensioners be financed?\nWHAT'S AFTER APPLYING ONLINE\nWhat's after applying online?\n\nVisit your nearest Riyad Bank branch with the following documents:\n\nCopy of valid Saudi national ID\nCompleted application form for Home Finance\nCompleted applicant undertaking form\nCompleted applicant health declaration\nSalary certificate with salary details\nBank statement\nDeposit of valuation fees\n\nFor more information please call our toll free number 800-124-2020\n\nThe calculations allow you to only simulate approximate loan amounts and estimated monthly repayments. For exact figures please contact us on: 800-124-2020, or visit any of our branches here.\n\nRead more \nEXPLORE MORE OPTIONS\nYou may also like\nCredit cards\nDistinct set of credit cards with innovative banking solutions to meet unique lifestyle\nAuto Leasing\nOwning a vehicle without having to pay the full amount upfront. \nHome finance\nOwning or building your dream home does not have to be your biggest concern.\nApply Online - Off -plan Programs\nOwn a property through off-plan projects in collaboration with the Housing Ministry and benefit from the housing subsidization to purchase the house of your dreams at the best price.\nPlease complete the form below\nInterested in\nPersonal Loan\nAuto Lease\nMortgage Finance\nInterested in\nPersonal Loan\nAuto Lease\nMortgage Finance\nBy ticking the checkbox, you agree to Riyad Bank collecting and processing and sharing [Name, National ID number, Email address, Mobile number, and city of residence.] For the purpose of assessing your financing request and enabling our sales team to contact you to complete the application process, as per the published privacy notice in the bank’s website.\nApply now\nCalculate\n\nBANKING MADE EASY FOR YOU\n\nLet us simplify your financial life\n\nJoin Riyad Bank for secure, seamless, and stress-free banking. Take the first step today.\n\nJoin Now\nCheck our Services\nNeed help?\nRiyad Line: 800 124 2225\nSupport Hotline\nContact us\nBranch & ATM\nView on map\nFAQ\nGet your answer\nProduct & Services\nAccounts\nCards\nFinance\nPrograms\nPayments & Transfers\nHassad World\nDigital Banking Channels\nRiyad Online\nRiyad Mobile\nRiyad Line\nRiyad ATM\nForeign Exchange ATM\nRiyad Smartwatches\nRiyad Self Service\nInfo, Tools & Services\nFinance Calculator\nIBAN Generator\nProduct Comparison\nRetail & Corporate\nRetail Banking Charges\nSuppliers Portal\nBanking Consumer Protection Principles\nTariff of Banking Services\nManage Cookies\nAbout us\nWho We Are\nCareers\nBoard of Directors\nBukra\nVision 2030\nAwards\nRiyad Bank Compliance\nCustomer Care\nPMI\nRiyad Bank Bylaws\nMedia Centre\nPress Releases\nPR & External Communication\nSponsorship Request\n© 2026 Riyad Bank. All rights Reserved\nRiyad Bank, Public Shareholding Company, Capital of S..R 40 Billion, Commercial Register (1010001054), P.O. Box 13519 Riyadh 6671, Tel. +966 11 4013030, National Address: King Abdullah Financial District (KAFD) Financial Boulevard - Al Aqeeq District - Building No. 3128 - Riyadh, Kingdom of Saudi Arabia. www.riyadbank.com, is licensed by the Council of Ministers Resolution (91) dated 23.11.1957, and regulated by Saudi Central Bank.\nPrivacy Notice\nTerms of Use\nSitemap",
